\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The tunnel curved in a gently tightening spiral until it opened abruptly into a large dock on the left. Ahead was a large, high-ceiling garage for an uncountable number of ground vehicles. It was empty. Eloise\'92s car eased to a halt within a few steps of an elevator of stainless steel, polished to a gentle immutable gleam. Its doors opened as Eloise alighted from her car, revealing a hold large enough for two football teams, their reserves, the referees, coaches, support staff and several dozen of their greatest fans.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise ushered the women in with her. As Alexander attempted to follow, she held her hand out to block him.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Mother!\'92 Alexander objected like a boy having his toys taken way. His eyes were huge and wet, and his eyebrows tangled over his nose. He took a sharp, attenuated, shallow breath.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise fussed with Alexander\'92s collar. \'91Be patient, my darling. We have wedding plans to make.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Really?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise kissed his cheek. \'91Of course. Now, I know you have important work to attend to. You know, I think it\'92s time you thought about syndicating 
\f2\i Candid Criminal
\f1\i0  internationally.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Well, yes, we\'92ve been thinking about Russia \'85\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91See, you\'92re already ahead of me,\'92 Eloise soothed. \'91Again.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Alexander sought out Sarah\'92s eyes, and didn\'92t notice her taking a step back as Kathy moved in front. Still he found them behind Kathy\'92s shoulder, and searched for some kind of confirmation. Sarah froze, knowing to look away would  sabotage Eloise\'92s gambit. She gulped and allowed her head to nod in a flutter.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Alexander was mollified; he exhaled in relief, even as the elevator doors closed only centimetres from his nose.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
